assets/local/*
!assets/local/README.md

# Debug markdown files (temporary)
*_FIXES.md
*_FIX.md
*_TRACE.md
*_LOGS.md
__pycache__/

# Playground (quick throwaway experiments, never committed)
playground/

# Variance-tool diff artifacts
*.diff.png
# render_golden.py writes the failing render beside its golden
tests/golden/*.actual.png

